<speak>Thank you, Mr Tan. Before we reach the closing part, we have room to deal with the administrative questions you set aside. Let's keep those separate from your other notes so you can find them later. You mentioned wanting a simpler routine for documents at home. Would you prefer to start with the portal navigation, or with how we arrange future telephone appointments? Either is fine for the flow of this conversation, and neither requires you to read personal details aloud.</speak>